<title>UK: Ivory &amp; Sime yr pre-tax up 5.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Ivory &amp; Sime yr pre-tax up 5.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>		  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (pence)	     14.40	    vs 13.71</p>
<p>    Dividend (pence)	 6.15	    vs  5.75</p>
<p>    Total dividend (pence) 9.00	    vs  8.25</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    6.89	    vs  6.53</p>
<p>    Turnover		  20.46	    vs 17.33</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said funds under management fell 25 percent to 3.2 billion pounds.</p>
<p>Full company name - Ivory &amp; Sime Plc</p>
<p>- London newsroom +171 542 5887</p>
